--- About ---
URL: https://v1.stageofproject.com/juicedfuel/about/
About Us

Revolutionizing the Way You Refuel

Juiced Fuel is revolutionizing the way you refuel. Our mission is simple: to provide a safer, smarter, and more convenient alternative to the traditional gas station. With just a tap on our app, we bring high-quality fuel straight to your car, boat, or fleet: no waiting, no wasted trips, no hassle.

What began as a family-run idea in Charleston has grown into a movement to simplify fueling for everyone. From busy parents to business owners and boaters, Juiced Fuel is making refueling faster, safer, and smarter, so you can keep moving forward without the pit stops.

 

Korey McDavid 

President/Founder

Korey went to Clemson and graduated in 2008. He was commissioned into the Army and selected to fly Apache helicopters. Korey graduated from flight school in 2011 and deployed to Iraq immediately following. He returned to Charleston in the summer of 2012 and continued flying with the South Carolina National Guard. Interested in the Oil and Gas industry, he started piloting remotely operated vehicles (ROVs) in the Gulf of Mexico for various oil companies performing subsea construction and surveys. Oil rig life was not conducive to family life, so Korey started working for Kinder Morgan, in Chicago, where he stored and transported various petroleum and petrochemical products. After a couple of years, he was offered the opportunity to move back to Charleston and manage a terminal for Kinder Morgan. At the Charleston terminal, Korey and his team would bring in bulk ships of refined petroleum products, store them, and load trucks to serve the greater Charleston fuel market. While at Kinder he also got his MBA from the University of Oklahoma with a focus in energy. This is where he got the itch to start his own business, and Juiced Fuel was born.

 

 

Caroline McDavid

Director of Customer Experience / Founder

Website: carolinemcdavid-official.com

Caroline brings the *juice* behind Juiced Fuel. A Charleston native at heart, she grew up moving around the country as the daughter of a Marine, which gave her adaptability and drive. With a background in paralegal work, nonprofit executive support, and event planning, she’s orchestrated everything from European business travel with top executives to large-scale philanthropic fundraisers and scholarship events.

But what truly sets Caroline apart is her creative eye and knack for going viral. She has a natural talent for storytelling and social media that has helped Juiced Fuel capture attention far beyond Charleston. Organized yet endlessly inventive, she thrives on helping people and turning everyday challenges into fresh opportunities.

As a mom of two busy boys and a French bulldog, Caroline knows firsthand how hectic life can be and maybe that’s why Juiced Fuel exists in the first place. With her gas tank always on empty, she’s the living proof that the best ideas are born from real life.

Recognition

Caroline McDavid was named to the 2026 SCBIZ Top 100 Women, recognizing high-achieving women making an impact across South Carolina through leadership, community service, and mentorship.

Our Story, In Motion

Juiced Fuel isn’t just about delivering gas, it’s about reshaping how people experience convenience. In this video, hear directly from our founders as they share why they started Juiced Fuel, the challenges they set out to solve, and the vision that drives us forward every day.

https://youtu.be/eaavcnVA094?si=HuUBGSElEp-L2V5p 

Are you Ready to fuel the future?

 

 Contact Us

