Bel Aire, Park City & Valley Center – Serving homes and fleets in Wichita’s thriving northern corridor.

Lakes & Recreation Areas – Fueling boats, ATVs, and equipment so your weekends stay uninterrupted.

Meet Your Local Owners: Cory & Nicole Angsten

Juiced Fuel Wichita is proudly led by Cory and Nicole Angsten — a husband-and-wife team with deep ties to both service and entrepreneurship.

 

Cory Angsten

Franchise Owner

Disabled Veteran of the United States Airforce. Served 2 tours overseas in Desert Storm/Desert Shield. After serving, moved to Nashville, TN where he wrote songs for record labels in the music industry. Also, during this time he became an entrepreneur, opening 2 successful businesses in Nashville.

 

Nicole Angsten

Franchise Owner

Born and raised in Wichita Ks, after attending college began a successful career with Textron Aviation. Nicole and Cory both started and operated 3 successful businesses in the Wichita area. Recently they sold off all but 1 of the businesses. The one remaining business is run by the middle of 3 children. Very excited to begin the franchise journey an bring Juiced Fuel to the Wichita area.

