Andrew and Sarah Settle

Andrew and Sarah Settle are lifelong residents of the Louisville and Southern Indiana area and proud graduates of the University of Louisville. Together, they’re excited to bring Juiced Fuel’s innovative mobile fuel delivery service to the community they’ve always called home.

Andrew has spent his career leading nonprofit organizations and driving community growth, most recently serving as CEO of the YMCA of Harrison County. His focus on building strong partnerships and leading meaningful projects has helped strengthen the region he’s passionate about. Sarah has built her career supporting teams and clients, helping businesses run more smoothly and deliver a better experience for the people they serve.

Blending their complementary strengths and shared entrepreneurial spirit, Andrew and Sarah saw Juiced Fuel as the perfect opportunity to simplify life for busy people while supporting local progress and innovation. As parents of three active kids, they understand firsthand how valuable convenience can be — and they’re proud to build a business that helps families and businesses alike reclaim more of their time.

Rooted in integrity, hard work, and hometown pride, Andrew and Sarah are fueling the future — one delivery at a time.

