Meet Your Local Owner

Etienne “ET” Clement

Franchise Owner

Etienne “ET” Clement is the single owner of Juiced Fuel North Texas. Louisiana-raised and a former Division I athlete, ET relocated to Texas to raise his family and build a business grounded in service, reliability, and Southern hospitality.
A former Special Forces Operations and Intelligence Advisor with the U.S. Army’s elite Green Berets and a 100% Disabled Veteran, ET brings deep leadership and operational experience. After his military service, he built a successful career in the hospitality industry, owning multiple restaurants and serving in executive leadership roles.
ET lives in Wylie, Texas, and remains a faith- and family-oriented leader dedicated to serving his community.

