About Juiced Fuel Austin

Your Local Mobile Fuel Delivery Service

Austin and the surrounding Hill Country run at a pace all their own – from early morning commutes and packed downtown schedules to weekends on the lake or exploring Hill Country trails. Between work, family, and everything this region offers, time is too valuable to spend waiting at a gas station.

That’s where Juiced Fuel comes in. We deliver high-quality fuel directly to you — a safer, smarter, and more convenient way to stay fueled. With a quick tap in our app, our bright orange trucks arrive at your home, office, fleet yard, or marina, keeping your vehicles, boats, generators, and equipment ready without the detours.

Founded on the belief that fueling should be effortless, Juiced Fuel combines modern convenience with reliable, professional service. Whether you’re a busy parent, a tech worker commuting downtown, a student navigating campus life, or a lake homeowner tired of hauling fuel cans down the dock, our mission is simple: keep Central Texas moving without interruption.

 
 

 Save Time

 

 No waiting in line — we bring the fuel to you. 

 
 

 Fuel Anywhere

 

 Driveway, office, school, gym, or marina. 

 
 

 Simple & Secure

 

 Easy in-app payments and emailed receipts. 

 Where We Deliver in Austin

 

Juiced Fuel is proud to serve drivers, families, businesses, and lake-goers across Central Texas. Our high-quality fuel delivery service brings fuel directly to you – at home, at work, on the water, or on the job site.

 

 Round Rock – Ideal for busy professionals, families, and growing businesses that appreciate fast, reliable fuel without the extra stop.
 

 

 Georgetown – From historic neighborhoods to expanding communities, we deliver convenience right to your driveway or job site.
 

 

 Cedar Park – Serving residential neighborhoods, local businesses, and job sites throughout this fast-growing Central Texas community.
 

 

 Lake LBJ & Lake Marble Falls – Keeping your boats, jet skis, and watercraft ready for the weekend with clean, high-quality marine fuel delivered dockside. Currently servicing the following zip codes: 78654, 78657, 78643, and 78639.
 

As Juiced Fuel ATX continues to grow, we’re expanding our service area to reach even more communities throughout Greater Austin. This includes future service to Lake Austin, Lake Travis, and additional neighborhoods, commercial areas, and job sites across Central Texas.

Meet Your Local Co-Owners

Juiced Fuel is locally owned and operated by two Round Rock families – the Hassels and Kiemsteadts – who have been part of the community for 25 years. Both couples raised their families here and value giving back to the place they call home. They spend much of their free time at their lake properties on Lake LBJ, enjoying boating and water sports. Through their own experience as boat owners, the Hassels and Kiemsteadts grew frustrated with spending valuable lake time fueling up before or after a weekend on the water. That shared experience sparked the decision to bring the Juiced Fuel franchise to Central Texas – providing convenient, reliable, service-focused fueling not only for boats, but also for vehicles and fleets across the region, so customers can spend less time on logistics and more time on what matters most.

Mike and Lisa Hassel

Franchise Owners

Mike and Lisa Hassel bring decades of leadership, service, and business experience to Juiced Fuel. Lisa has been a successful Realtor® with Coldwell Banker for the past 12 years, following a 20+ year career in tech marketing focused on brand strategy, customer experience, and business growth. She applies that same customer-first mindset to Juiced Fuel’s marketing and business development. Mike is a retired U.S. Army helicopter pilot and current life flight pilot with Air Evac Life Team, bringing experience in planning, logistics, and safety. Mike and Lisa have been married for 32 years and have raised two adult children.

Amy and Clint Kiemsteadt

Franchise Owners

Amy and Clint Kiemsteadt play key roles in both the operational and customer-facing sides of Juiced Fuel. Clint has spent more than 20 years in cybersecurity sales, focusing on solving complex challenges and delivering results. He brings that same approach to guiding sales strategy and customer relationships at Juiced Fuel. Amy, a former teacher, manages daily operations with a focus on organization, reliability, and service. She has been actively involved in the Round Rock community through years of volunteer work and service on various local boards. They are high school sweethearts and parents of three adult children.

