Charlotte, North Carolina — Juiced Fuel, a nationwide mobile fuel delivery company, is bringing its on-demand and scheduled fueling services to the Charlotte metro area, offering a convenient alternative to traditional gas station fueling for businesses and households.

The Charlotte operation is led by local owners and sibling duo Jeff Hanood and Kelly Wells, who are focused on delivering reliable, service-driven fueling solutions across the region.

Juiced Fuel provides fuel delivery directly to vehicles through its mobile app, allowing customers to schedule recurring service or request fuel on demand. Commercial customers in construction, landscaping, logistics, and service trades can keep vehicles fueled on-site without interrupting daily operations.

In addition to fleet services, Juiced Fuel offers household fueling for busy parents and working professionals. Residential customers can have fuel delivered directly to personal vehicles parked at home, helping eliminate last-minute gas station stops and saving valuable time.

“Charlotte is home for me,” said Korey McDavid, CEO of Juiced Fuel, who was born and raised in Charlotte. “Bringing Juiced Fuel to this community is especially meaningful, and with Jeff Hanood and Kelly Wells leading our local operation, we are excited to serve both businesses and families throughout the area.”

Juiced Fuel services in Charlotte include:

On-site fueling for commercial fleets

Scheduled recurring fuel deliveries

Household fueling for personal vehicles

On-demand fueling through the Juiced Fuel app

Businesses and residents can begin scheduling fuel delivery immediately through the Juiced Fuel app or by contacting the company directly.

About Juiced Fuel
Juiced Fuel is a nationwide mobile fuel delivery company providing convenient, safe, and efficient fueling solutions for businesses and individuals. By combining technology with dependable service, Juiced Fuel helps customers save time and simplify fuel management.

