Why I Started Juiced Fuel

As the owner bringing Juiced Fuel to Arizona’s East Valley, Christopher is excited to combine his passion for cars with a service that makes life easier for fellow enthusiasts and busy families alike.

Christopher Craig

Franchise Owner

Christopher Craig Owner Christopher Craig was born and raised in Southern California, where a lifelong love of speed, competition, and car culture started early. Growing up he raced go-karts, rode BMX, surfed, skated, and played club soccer before eventually discovering hockey in his early teens—a sport that quickly became a lasting passion.

He earned a Bachelor of Science in eBusiness and Technology from the University of Phoenix and moved to Arizona more than 25 years ago to build a career in technology, risk management, and security. While his professional career focused on protecting organizations and managing risk, his free time has always revolved around performance, motorsports, and community.

Christopher is an avid sim racer, a lifelong karting enthusiast, and has competed in endurance races including the 24 Hours of Lemons. He also enjoys track days whenever he can make it to the circuit and has a deep appreciation for all things automotive—from grassroots racing to the broader car enthusiast culture.

Outside of motorsports, Christopher is deeply involved in youth athletics and currently coaches a Girls 19U AA travel hockey team. He values the lessons sports teach—discipline, teamwork, and resilience—and enjoys helping young athletes develop both on and off the ice.

As the owner bringing Juiced Fuel to Arizona’s East Valley, Christopher is excited to combine his passion for cars with a service that makes life easier for fellow enthusiasts and busy families alike. His goal is simple: help people skip the pump so their cars, boats, golf carts, and toys are always fueled and ready for whatever comes next.

Stephanie Mansour

Franchise Owner​

Stephanie is the heart of Juiced Fuel. Where Mike brings the fire, Stephanie brings the focus. With a natural gift for organization, branding, and customer experience, she ensures Juiced isn’t just fast—it’s exceptional. Stephanie believes businesses should feel personal and that service should go beyond expectations. Her vision is simple: make life easier for families, businesses, and fleets across Rhode Island.

Callaway Mansour

Chief Energy Officer

Callaway is the inspiration behind it all. At just six years old, he reminds us why we hustle—not just for success, but for freedom: freedom to spend more time together and build something lasting. As our “Chief Energy Officer,” he brings the biggest energy on the team and represents the future we’re building toward.

