--- Juiced Fuel Charleston Supports Mount Pleasant Academy’s Winter 2026 Silent Auction & Oyster Roast ---
URL: https://v1.stageofproject.com/juicedfuel/juiced-fuel-charleston-mount-pleasant-academy-silent-auction/
At Juiced Fuel, being part of the community means showing up for the places and people that matter most—especially our local schools.

We were proud to support Mount Pleasant Academy at their Winter 2026 silent auction and oyster roast fundraiser, an event dedicated to raising funds that directly benefit students, teachers, and school programs. Events like these are such a meaningful part of the Mount Pleasant and Charleston community, bringing families together while supporting education in a fun, local way.

As a Charleston-based fuel delivery service, we’re always looking for ways to give back. As part of our contribution, Juiced Fuel donated a “Stay Juiced All Year” package, featuring free gas for a year (up to $1,000) along with a complimentary Juiced Fuel membership. It was our way of supporting a school community that means so much to our team and our families.

There’s something really special about a Lowcountry oyster roast fundraiser—parents, teachers, and local businesses all coming together for a great cause. It’s a tradition that perfectly captures the spirit of the Charleston area, and we’re grateful to be part of it.

Supporting local schools, education initiatives, and community fundraisers in Charleston, Mount Pleasant, and surrounding areas is at the core of what we do. We’re proud to partner with organizations like Mount Pleasant Academy and look forward to continuing to support the people and places that make this community so strong.

If you’re new to Juiced Fuel, we provide on-demand fuel delivery for cars, boats, and fleets, helping you skip the gas station and keep moving—whether you’re at home, work, or on the water.

Here’s to more moments that bring people together and more ways to fuel what matters most.

