At Juiced Fuel Charleston, we’ve always believed we’re here to fuel more than just vehicles—we’re here to support the people and communities around us.

Recently, we had the opportunity to partner with Because We Claire, an incredible organization dedicated to supporting families impacted by blood cancer. Their mission is simple but powerful: to provide care, connection, and resources to families navigating some of life’s hardest moments.

We were proud to be part of a local Daddy Daughter Dance, where we connected with families in our community and found a meaningful way to give back. During the event, Juiced Fuel donated 100% of tips collected directly to support Because We Claire and the families they serve.

It’s partnerships like this that remind us why we do what we do. Being part of the Charleston community means showing up—not just with a service, but with intention.

We’re honored to support Because We Claire and their mission, and we look forward to continuing to find ways to give back to the people who make this community so special.

