--- Memorial Day: What It Means to Us as a Veteran-Owned Business ---
URL: https://v1.stageofproject.com/juicedfuel/memorial-day-veteran-owned-business/
Memorial Day isn’t just another holiday on the calendar for us.

As a veteran-owned business, it carries a weight that’s hard to fully explain unless you’ve lived it or stood close to someone who has. It’s not about a long weekend, a cookout, or the start of summer. It’s about remembering the men and women who gave everything — not just through service, but through sacrifice.

For us, it’s personal.

It’s remembering the people who didn’t come home. The families who carry that loss every day. The friendships, the stories, and the moments that never got to continue. Memorial Day is a pause — a moment to step back from the pace of life and recognize what was given so the rest of us could keep moving forward.

At Juiced Fuel, that perspective shapes how we show up — not just on this day, but every day.

There’s a deep sense of pride in building something meaningful, knowing it was made possible by those who served before us. It influences the way we treat people, the way we lead, and the level of responsibility we feel to do things the right way. Integrity, accountability, and showing up for others aren’t just business values — they’re rooted in something much deeper.

We also recognize that service doesn’t end when someone takes off the uniform.

Many veterans carry that same commitment into their communities, their families, and their work. Supporting that transition, honoring that mindset, and continuing to give back where we can is something we take seriously.

Memorial Day is a reminder of why that matters.

It’s a day to honor, reflect, and never take for granted the freedom to build, grow, and live the lives we do. And while we may not always have the right words, we carry the meaning with us in how we operate and who we strive to be.

Today, we remember.

--- Juiced Fuel Partners with Fleetio: A Smarter Future for Fleet Fueling ---
URL: https://v1.stageofproject.com/juicedfuel/juiced-fuel-fleetio-partnership/
Juiced Fuel is proud to announce our new partnership with Fleetio, a leading fleet management platform trusted by companies across North America. This partnership marks a major step forward in how we serve commercial fleets by combining Juiced Fuel’s on-demand fueling solutions with Fleetio’s powerful fleet management technology.

Fleetio helps businesses manage vehicles, maintenance, inspections, fuel spend, compliance, and operational performance all in one platform. By integrating with Fleetio, companies gain better visibility into fleet costs, maintenance schedules, and fuel usage while reducing manual paperwork and disconnected systems.

What This Means for Juiced Fuel Customers

For our customers, this partnership means a more connected and efficient fueling experience. Businesses using Fleetio can streamline how they track fueling activity, vehicle data, and operating expenses while keeping everything organized within a centralized system.

That means:

Easier fuel transaction tracking

Better reporting and cost visibility

Improved fleet efficiency

Reduced downtime and administrative work

Smarter decisions based on real-time fleet data

Fleetio’s platform is built to help fleets optimize spend, stay ahead of maintenance needs, and improve uptime—making it a natural fit for Juiced Fuel’s mission of keeping fleets moving.

Why It Matters

Fuel is one of the largest operating expenses for many fleet businesses. Fleetio notes that integrated fuel management allows companies to automatically track expenses, monitor fuel economy, identify misuse, and uncover savings opportunities.

By pairing Juiced Fuel’s convenient mobile fueling model with Fleetio’s software capabilities, customers now have a smarter way to manage one of their most important costs while improving day-to-day operations.

A Partnership Built for Growth

At Juiced Fuel, we are always looking for innovative ways to bring more value to our customers. Partnering with Fleetio allows us to deliver more than fuel—we’re helping businesses modernize their fleet operations and scale with confidence.

Whether managing a small local fleet or a large commercial operation, this partnership gives customers the tools to save time, lower costs, and operate more efficiently.

Looking Ahead

This is just the beginning. Juiced Fuel remains committed to using technology, service, and innovation to redefine fleet fueling. With Fleetio as a partner, we are excited to help more businesses run smarter, move faster, and stay fueled for success.

--- Juiced Fuel Expands Into Central Massachusetts, Opening August 2026 ---
URL: https://v1.stageofproject.com/juicedfuel/juiced-fuel-central-massachusetts/
Juiced Fuel, the veteran-founded and family-driven mobile fuel delivery company headquartered in Charleston, is proud to announce its expansion into Central Massachusetts, with service scheduled to begin in August 2026. The new territory will be led by local firefighter Jerry Lucey alongside his wife Katie Lucey.

The Central Massachusetts expansion marks another step in Juiced Fuel’s continued growth as demand increases for safer, more convenient fueling solutions for both consumers and businesses.

Juiced Fuel delivers fuel directly to customers wherever their vehicles or equipment are located, including homes, businesses, fleet yards, construction sites, and marinas. Customers can order fuel on demand or set up recurring fueling schedules through the Juiced Fuel app.

“Jerry and Katie represent exactly the type of people we want growing the Juiced Fuel brand,” said Korey McDavid, CEO of Juiced Fuel. “Their commitment to service, community, and people-first values aligns perfectly with our mission. We are excited to bring the Juiced Fuel experience to Central Massachusetts.”

As a firefighter, Jerry Lucey brings a strong background in public service, safety, and community engagement. Together, the family-operated team plans to focus on delivering white glove fueling services to residential customers, commercial fleets, and marine customers throughout the region.

Juiced Fuel continues to expand nationwide with a focus on simplifying the fueling experience while helping customers save time and avoid traditional gas station trips.

“Our mission is to offer everyone a simpler and safer alternative to traditional refueling. We sell convenience and safety one gallon at a time.”

For more information about Juiced Fuel, visit: Juicedfuel.com

Media Contact

Sarah McCann
Sarah@JuicedFuel.com

--- Juiced Fuel Expands Into Southeast Houston, Texas, Opening August 2026 ---
URL: https://v1.stageofproject.com/juicedfuel/juiced-fuel-southeast-houston/
Juiced Fuel, the veteran-founded and family-driven mobile fuel delivery company headquartered in Charleston, is proud to announce its expansion into Southeast Houston, Texas, with service scheduled to begin in August 2026. The new territory will be led by local franchise partners Corgins Banner and Tennille Banner.

The Southeast Houston expansion marks another step in Juiced Fuel’s continued nationwide growth as demand rises for safer, more convenient fueling solutions for residential customers, commercial fleets, and marine operations.

Juiced Fuel delivers fuel directly to customers wherever their vehicles or equipment are located, including homes, businesses, fleet yards, construction sites, and marinas. Customers can order fuel on demand or schedule recurring fueling services through the Juiced Fuel app.

“Corgins and Tennille embody the entrepreneurial spirit and people-first mindset that define the Juiced Fuel brand,” said Korey McDavid, CEO of Juiced Fuel. “We are excited to continue expanding throughout Texas and bring our white glove fueling service to Southeast Houston and the surrounding communities.”

The Southeast Houston territory will focus on providing convenient fueling solutions for busy families, business owners, commercial fleets, and boaters throughout the region. With Houston’s strong industrial, transportation, and marine presence, the expansion is expected to support a wide variety of fueling needs across the local market.

Juiced Fuel continues to expand across the country with a mission centered around convenience, safety, and customer service.

