URL: https://v1.stageofproject.com/juicedfuel/red-white-and-fuel/
FUEL FORWARD FOUNDATION PRESENTS

 Red,

 White

 & Fuel:

 Juiced Fuel Franchise Award

 One qualified U.S. military veteran, active-duty service member, National Guard member, or Reserve member will receive the opportunity to own and operate a Juiced Fuel franchise. The award includes the Juiced Fuel Initial Franchise Fee and eligible travel accommodations, while training, onboarding, and ongoing operational support are provided through Juiced Fuel’s established franchise system.

 

 Check Eligibility

 

 

 View Official Rules

 

 

 ABOUT THE FRANCHISE OPPORTUNITY

 The Franchise Opportunity Behind the Award

 The Fuel Forward Foundation is awarding one Juiced Fuel franchise opportunity to a qualified U.S. military veteran, active-duty service member, National Guard member, or Reserve member. The award includes the Juiced Fuel Initial Franchise Fee and eligible travel accommodations.

 As a Juiced Fuel franchise owner, the selected recipient will receive comprehensive training, onboarding, and ongoing franchise support while building a business backed by an established brand and proven operating system.

 
 

 

Veteran-Led

 Built on values of integrity, discipline, and execution.
 

 
 
 

 

Operations-Driven

 Optimized routing, reporting, and seamless fuel delivery operations.
 

 
 

 

 

Built For Growth

 A scalable model designed for ambitious owner-operators.
 

 

 

Franchise Opportunity

 AWARDED BY FUEL FORWARD FOUNDATION

 What The Winner Receives

 

Everything you need to begin your franchise journey.

The award covers the Juiced Fuel Initial Franchise Fee and eligible travel accommodations. As a franchise owner, the selected recipient will also receive training, onboarding, and ongoing operational support through the Juiced Fuel franchise system.

 

 

 

 Initial Franchise Fee 

The Fuel Forward Foundation covers the Juiced Fuel Initial Franchise Fee, helping launch your franchise ownership journey.

 

 

 

 

 

 Travel Accommodations 

Eligible travel expenses for required onboarding and training are included as outlined in the Official Rules.

 

 

 

 

 Training & Onboarding 

Hands-on onboarding and training covering operations, safety, customer service, and daily franchise operations.

 

 

 

 

 Operational Support 

Hands-on guidance from the Juiced Fuel team during setup, launch, and early operational stages.

 

 

 

 

 Established Systems 

Built around operational workflows, vendor relationships, and systems designed for scalable execution.

 

 

 

 

 Ongoing Guidance 

Continued mentorship and operational direction designed to support long-term franchise development.

 

 WHO CAN APPLY 

Built For Veterans Ready To Lead.

This opportunity is open to eligible U.S. military veterans, active-duty service members, National Guard members, and Reserve members who are ready to pursue franchise ownership and business leadership.

Before applying, you’ll complete a quick territory availability check using your ZIP code. If your territory is eligible, you’ll be guided directly to the application process.

Basic Eligibility Requirements

 

 U.S. Veteran, Active Duty, Reserve, or National Guard
 

 

 21 years of age or older
 

 

 Demonstrate a minimum of $50,000 in available liquid capital
 

 

 Valid government-issued photo ID
 

 

 Willing to complete onboarding and training requirements
 

 

 Must meet territory eligibility requirements
 

 

 Must agree to the Official Rules and Promotion Terms
 

* Territory eligibility is determined through the ZIP code validation process and may vary based on franchise availability and registration requirements.

 

