Nominate a Veteran

Thank you for taking the time to nominate a deserving veteran for the Red, White and Fuel: Juiced Fuel Franchise Award.

Please provide as much detail as possible about the individual you are nominating. Your recommendation will help the Fuel Forward Foundation identify qualified candidates for review and consideration.

 

Your Journey to Franchise Ownership

The Red, White & Fuel: Juiced Fuel Franchise Award follows a structured review process designed to identify qualified military applicants with the leadership, commitment, and business readiness to become successful franchise owners. Begin by confirming your territory eligibility, then complete the application and follow the evaluation process outlined in the Official Rules.

 1

Territory Validation

 Verify franchise territory availability using your ZIP code before beginning the application.
 

 2

Application & Eligibility

 Complete your application, upload the required documentation, and verify your eligibility.
 

 3

Franchise Readiness

 Review the Franchise Disclosure Document (FDD) and complete the readiness process.
 

 4

Discovery Day

 Attend Discovery Day to meet the Juiced Fuel team and learn about the franchise opportunity.
 

 5

Independent Evaluation

 Applications are independently reviewed and scored using the official judging criteria.
 

 6

Franchise Award

 Following final score verification, one qualified applicant receives the Red, White & Fuel Franchise Award.
 

Meet the Independent Judging Panel

The Red, White and Fuel: Juiced Fuel Franchise Award recipient will be selected through a structured evaluation process led by respected military and business leaders. Each finalist will be interviewed and evaluated using standardized judging criteria to ensure a fair, transparent, and merit-based selection process.

