Frequently Asked Questions

We’ve answered the most common questions about the Veteran Franchise Giveaway, eligibility, application process, and next steps.

 

 

 Who is eligible to apply?

Applicants must be U.S. veterans, 18 years or older, possess a valid driver’s license, and reside in an eligible territory or market approved by Juiced Fuel.

 

 

 Is there any cost to apply?

No. There is no purchase necessary to submit an application for the Veteran Franchise Giveaway.

 

 

 Do I need prior franchise experience?

No. Leadership, discipline, and operational mindset matter more than prior franchise ownership experience.

 

 

 Can I apply outside the listed starter markets?

Possibly. Market availability may change throughout the giveaway period based on territory status and franchise development activity.

 

 

 Can active military members apply?

The current program is primarily focused on veterans. Final eligibility requirements will be outlined in the official rules.

 

 

 What type of video should I submit?

Your video should briefly introduce who you are, your military background, leadership experience, and why you want to own a Juiced Fuel franchise.

 

 

 Do I upload the actual video file?

No. Applicants will submit a shareable video link (YouTube, Loom, Vimeo, or Google Drive).

 

 

 How are finalists selected?

Applications are reviewed based on eligibility, leadership background, professionalism, and alignment with the Juiced Fuel mission.

 

 

 What happens if territories change during the contest?

Available territories are subject to change throughout the application process and may become unavailable prior to winner selection.

 

 

 How long does the application process take?

The initial application is designed to be short and straightforward, with additional review happening during finalist selection.

Ready To Submit Your Application?

Applications for the Red, White & Fuel: Juiced Fuel Franchise Award close on October 1, 2026.

Complete your application, upload your required materials, and submit your entry before the application deadline. Qualified applicants will move forward through the official review and selection process.

 

 Start My Application

 

 

 

