 Juiced Fuel proudly serves Wilmington, North Carolina, and the surrounding coastal communities with technology-driven mobile fuel delivery for businesses, fleets, construction sites, marinas, and residential customers. From the historic streets of Downtown Wilmington to Ogden, Mayfaire, Masonboro, Wrightsville Beach, Carolina Beach, Surf City and Hampstead, as well as surrounding coastal communities we deliver fuel directly where it’s needed.

