Meet Richard Kosse – Leading Juiced Fuel in Wilmington

Richard Kosse is a seasoned operations executive with a well-established track record in multi-unit service environments. Majority of Richard’s career has been spent as Senior Director of Operations, with demonstrated success in food-service and healthcare operations management. His career has been marked by driving efficiency, scaling teams, and ensuring consistent execution across multiple sites.

In his new venture as the market-leader for the Juiced Fuel Wilmington, NC region, Richard brings a strategic mindset, operational rigor, and a strong leadership presence that will be instrumental in launching and growing the franchise in his market. His background gives him a deep familiarity with complex logistics, high-service-level expectations and the discipline required to deliver the Juiced Fuel brand and customer focused service to the region. 

Richard is energized by the opportunity to bring Juiced Fuel’s innovative mobile-fueling franchise to Wilmington, leveraging his operational acumen, team-building experience and commitment to customer excellence. Under his leadership, the Wilmington market is poised to become a high-performing franchise location with strong local brand visibility and exceptional service levels. 

