Jay Rainey – Operations Manager, Juiced Fuel Hilton Head & Bluffton

Bluffton has been home ever since I moved here from Connecticut back in 2007. Over the last 11 years as a local business owner, I’ve deeply planted my roots in this community and fell in love with the challenge of growing and building businesses. Many of you might know me from building up my local shop, The Butcher’s Market and Deli—which my wife still proudly runs right here in town!

To me, business is very simple: without your customers, you have absolutely nothing. I built the butcher shop on a straightforward formula of treating every single customer like gold, and I am bringing that exact same philosophy to Juiced Fuel.

While the deli is thriving, I recently made the leap to Juiced Fuel because the mobile fleet fueling concept is a total game-changer for local businesses, and the team behind Juiced Fuel are absolutely top-notch. I love the grit it takes to build a company, and I’m fully committed to delivering that gold-standard service to our fleet partners and boat owners across Bluffton and Hilton Head.

