Meet Aaron Schulz – Bringing Juiced Fuel to Lincoln

Aaron Schulz was born and raised in Holdrege, Nebraska, and graduated from the University of Nebraska–Lincoln before spending more than 15 years as a federal civilian supporting the U.S. Air Force and Army. His career took him from Colorado Springs to Rammstein, Germany, and back home to Offutt Air Force Base, gaining valuable experience as a contracting officer in research, logistics, and operations. Now back in Nebraska with his wife, Marybeth, and their six children—Aaron is bringing Juiced Fuel to Lincoln, NE as a way to serve families, businesses, and the community he loves. He and his family are excited to simplify life for their neighbors, and be part of what makes Nebraska the good life.

