About Juiced Fuel NEPA

Your Local Mobile Fuel Delivery Service

Juiced Fuel of Northeast Pennsylvania (NEPA) is a locally owned and operated mobile fuel delivery company serving commercial fleets, businesses, construction sites, marinas, organizations, and residential customers. We deliver gasoline and diesel directly to vehicles and equipment, helping reduce downtime, improve efficiency, and eliminate unnecessary trips to the pump.

Owned and operated by brothers Bill and Chris Kroski, lifelong Northeastern Pennsylvania residents, Juiced Fuel is built on a commitment to reliable service, strong community relationships, and putting customers first.

Whether supporting business operations or simplifying everyday fueling, Juiced Fuel of NEPA is proud to provide dependable, convenient fuel delivery that helps keep Northeastern Pennsylvania moving.

 
 

 Save Time

 

 Eliminate fuel runs and keep drivers, crews, and equipment focused on the job. 

 
 

 Fuel Where You Work

 

 Fleet yards, construction sites, marinas, fuel tanks, and business locations. 

 
 

 Efficient & Reliable

 

 Technology-driven fuel delivery backed by professional service and real-time visibility. 

 Where We Deliver in NEPA

 

Juiced Fuel proudly serves commercial fleets, businesses, construction sites, marinas, organizations, and residential customers across Northeastern Pennsylvania. We deliver gasoline and diesel directly to your location—whether it’s your business, job site, marina, or home.

Luzerne & Lackawanna Counties

Luzerne and Lackawanna counties are the economic hub of Northeastern Pennsylvania, home to growing businesses, commercial fleets, industrial operations, and thriving local communities. With a mix of urban centers, suburban neighborhoods, and rural areas, dependable fuel delivery helps businesses stay productive while providing residents with a more convenient way to fuel their vehicles and equipment.

Meet Your Local Co-Owners

The franchise is owned and operated by brothers Bill and Chris Kroski, longtime residents of Northeastern Pennsylvania who were born and raised in the region they proudly serve. Their deep local roots and commitment to the community drive the company’s customer-first approach and high standards of service. Together, the brothers combine leadership, teamwork, and real-world experience to build a business grounded in reliability and trust.

Bill Kroski 

Franchise Owner

Bill Kroski is an 18-year veteran of the United States Army, having dedicated his career to service, leadership, and the well-being of others. He currently serves as a physician with the Department of Veterans Affairs, where he provides care to fellow veterans, while also holding the role of Brigade Surgeon in the Army National Guard. His dual commitment to medicine and military leadership reflects a lifelong dedication to those who serve.
Beyond his professional and military career, Bill is driven by an entrepreneurial mindset. He has built a diverse portfolio of real estate investments and is continually seeking opportunities that create value and strengthen local communities. He is particularly excited to enter the fuel delivery and service industry, with a focus on reliably serving his hometown and supporting its growth.
Bill lives in Jenkins with his wife, Kelle, and their three children. Deeply rooted in family, service, and community, he brings discipline, integrity, and vision to every role he undertakes.

Chris Kroski

Franchise Owner

Chris Kroski has built a career defined by teamwork, discipline, and service. He works as a surveyor in heavy civil construction, playing a critical role in complex infrastructure projects that support and strengthen local communities.
In addition to his work in construction, Chris dedicated 14 years to a career in law enforcement, where he served with integrity and a strong sense of duty. His professional background is further shaped by an eight-year career in professional baseball, an experience that reinforced his team-driven mindset, leadership skills, and commitment to excellence.
Chris lives in Duryea with his wife, Jess, and their two daughters. Deeply committed to giving back, he serves his community as the Director of Softball for Grind Athletics and as a Little League coach, helping mentor young athletes and foster teamwork, confidence, and sportsmanship in the next generation.

Fueling Solutions Built Around Your Operation

From fleet fueling and onsite fuel storage to marine fueling and organizational programs, Juiced Fuel delivers flexible, technology-driven fueling solutions designed to reduce downtime, improve productivity, and keep your operation moving.

 

Fleet Fueling

Every minute spent at a gas station is time your team isn’t serving customers, completing jobs, or generating revenue. Juiced Fuel fuels your vehicles while they’re parked, helping drivers start each day with full tanks and no unnecessary fuel stops.

Eliminate employee fueling stops

Increase driver productivity

Reduce fuel card misuse

Custom recurring fueling schedules

Ideal For
Construction companies, service fleets, delivery operations, municipalities, and contractors.

Onsite Fuel Storage

Maintain a reliable fuel supply at your location with flexible onsite fuel storage solutions. We help businesses improve efficiency through customized storage and replenishment programs.

Fuel available when and where you need it

Reduced operational downtime

Scheduled replenishment services

Flexible lease or purchase options

Ideal For
Construction sites, fleet yards, generator systems, agricultural operations, and industrial facilities.

 

Juiced for Organizations

Provide employees, residents, and members with convenient access to mobile fuel delivery through a customized organizational fueling program.

Exclusive member pricing

Preferred scheduling options

Community fueling events

Increased member satisfaction

Ideal For
Corporate campuses, HOAs, apartment communities, country clubs, universities, and business parks.

Marine Fueling

Professional dockside fueling services designed to keep boats, yachts, and marine operations moving with less time spent at crowded fuel docks.

Reliable dockside fueling

Flexible scheduling

Reduced fueling downtime

Professional marine support

Ideal For
Recreational boat owners, yacht owners, charter operators, marinas, and waterfront communities.

 

