Notes

1.      The low-end of this range assumes that you purchase one territory, and the high-
     end of this range assumes that you purchase five territories.

2.       For your base of operations, you will need to rent space to park your vehicles, store
     equipment, and site your fuel tanks. Due to the fuel tanks, you will typically need a location that
     is zoned for light industrial use. Typically, the fuel tanks are 1,000 gallons each, and are usually
