     remodeling, or decorating the premises.

            B.       Hiring and training employees. All hiring decisions and conditions of employment
     are your sole responsibility. (Section 7.5)

             C.      Necessary equipment, signs, fixtures, opening inventory, and supplies. We will
     provide you a list of our specifications and approved suppliers for equipment, signs, fixtures,
     opening inventory, and supplies necessary to open your business. (Section 5.2) We do not provide
     these items directly; we only provide the names of approved suppliers. We do not deliver or install
     these items.

             D.     Brand Standards Manual. We will give you access to our Brand Standards Manual
