Computer Systems

       We require you to purchase computer systems and software as follows: desktop/laptop with
standard peripherals for office use, iPhone, and Stripe point of sale software. You must also use
our proprietary Juiced Fuel app for operations.

       Stripe allows businesses to accept payments and manage sales directly through the Juiced
Fuel application. The system will generate or store data such as sales analytics and customer
account information.

      The Juiced Fuel app has a dashboard for you and systems for your drivers and your
customers. Customers use the app to schedule deliveries, make payments, and other functions.

       We estimate that these systems will cost between $100 and $1,000 to purchase. The low
end assumes you already own a computer and iPhone suitable for business use. The cost of the
Juiced Fuel app is included with the monthly Technology Fee.

       We are not obligated to provide any ongoing maintenance, repairs, upgrades, or updates.
We do not require you enter into any such contract with a third party (other than subscription
software).

        You must upgrade or update any system when we determine. There is no contractual limit
on the frequency or cost of this obligation.

       We estimate that the annual cost of any optional or required maintenance, updating,
upgrading, or support contracts will be $0 to $1,000 (other than our Technology Fee).

        You must give us independent access to the information that will be generated or stored in
these systems. The information that we may access will include sales, customer data, and reports.
There is no contractual limitation on our right to access the information.

