Grant of Territory

Your franchise agreement will specify a territory, which will be described in an exhibit to
your franchise agreement before its execution. The boundaries of your territory will be specified
by zip codes, county or city lines, or some other boundary. Each territory that you purchase will
have approximately 300,000 people, although the exact amount may vary according to factors such
as demographics, geography, and political or zip code lines.

Relocation; Establishment of Additional Outlets

You may relocate your business operations center anywhere in your territory, as long as
your location meets any applicable requirements that we have.

You do not have the right to establish additional franchised outlets or expand into
additional territory. If you desire to do so, you must (1) meet our then-current criteria for new
franchisees, (2) be in compliance with your franchise agreement at all times since opening your
business, (3) have demonstrated your capability to operate a multi-territory franchise successfully,
and (4) obtain our agreement.

Options to Acquire Additional Franchises

You do not receive any options, rights of first refusal, or similar rights to acquire additional
franchises.

Exclusivity

We grant you an exclusive territory. In your territory, we will not establish either a
company-owned or franchised outlet selling the same or similar goods or services under the same
or similar trademarks or service marks as a Juiced Fuel outlet.

You must meet or exceed a minimum amount of sales each month. If you buy multiple
territories, you must meet or exceed the minimum in each territory. The minimums are shown on
the following chart:
or franchised outlet selling the same or similar goods or services under the same
or similar trademarks or service marks as a Juiced Fuel outlet.

