         Notes

         1.     The table above shows a summary adjusted profit statement for the Juiced Fuel
operated by our affiliate Juiced Fuel Inc. in calendar year 2025. It is the only location that operated
for all of 2025. This information is a historic financial performance representation.

        2.     This Juiced Fuel business is located in Charleston, South Carolina. It began
operating in 2023. Characteristics of this outlet related to its geographic location, such as
population density, demographics, fuel costs, and climate, may differ materially from those of the
outlet that may be offered to you. Unlike your franchise, it does not have specific geographical
boundaries. It serves a population approximately equal to two territories. It currently has three
trucks in operation.

       3.      “Sales” means the total revenue derived from the sale of goods or services less
discounts and refunds. It does not include sales taxes.

       4.          “Cost of Goods Sold” refers to the costs of raw materials, in this case, fuel
purchased.

         5.        “Gross Profit” is Sales minus Cost of Goods Sold.

       6.      “Labor Cost” is our affiliate’s cost of hourly labor, including payroll processing. It
does not include salary or compensation for our owners or workers comp insurance.

       7.     “Rent” is our affiliate’s cost for leased space. It began making lease payments in
February 2025.

        8.      “Vehicle Expenses” is our affiliate’s costs for fuel, vehicle insurance, vehicle
registration, repairs, and other vehicle related expenditures. Although we have four trucks, we
operated only two trucks in 2025. We excluded expenses associated with the two additional trucks
that were not used in 2025.

