                   release upon renewal of the Agreement.

         (9)       Limitation of Claims: Franchisee is not required to consent to a limitation of claims.
                   The statute of limitations under North Dakota law applies.

         (10)      Enforcement of Agreement: The prevailing party in any enforcement action is
